/P 75 0 R
/E (PowerPoints and other visuals are welcome and should be emailed ahead of time to mic@cityofkingston.ca. All presentation materials are due by 4:00 p.m. on Tuesday, March 17. Please submit your presentation as a PowerPoint file and embed all videos, demos, or other media directly in the deck. Wi-Fi at City Hall can be unreliable, so this will help ensure your presentation runs smoothly when we download it in advance. )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [4]
>>
