447 0 obj
<<
/Title (The competition will kick off on Friday, March 20 at 9 a.m. in the Council Chambers at City Hall. Please arrive by no later than  8:45 a.m. so we can get you settled. You can use the main front door on Ontario Street and make your way to the second floor. Each pitch will last up to 8 minutes for the presentation and 5 minutes for Q&A. You are welcome to use your submission video as part of your pitch if you wish \(leaving you the remaining time for a presentation\). PowerPoints and other visuals are welcome and should be emailed ahead of time to mic@cityofkingston.ca. All presentation materials are due by 4:00 p.m. on Tuesday, March 17. Please submit your presentation as a PowerPoint file and embed all videos, demos, or other media directly in the deck. Wi-Fi at City Hall can be unreliable, so this will help ensure your presentation runs smoothly when we download it in advance.)
